sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (Mobile / Web)
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant IAM as Identity & Tenant Service
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant RD as Redis
  U->>GW: POST /auth/login {email, password}
  GW->>RD: rate-limit check (IP + email)
  GW->>IAM: authenticate(email, password)
  IAM->>PG: SELECT user, tenant, role WHERE email
  PG-->>IAM: user row (bcrypt hash)
  alt valid credentials and active tenant
    IAM->>IAM: verify bcrypt hash, check 2FA for managers
    IAM->>PG: INSERT audit_log (LOGIN_SUCCESS)
    IAM-->>GW: access JWT (15 min) + refresh token (7 days)<br/>claims: sub, tenant_id, role
    GW-->>U: 200 OK + tokens
  else invalid
    IAM->>PG: INSERT audit_log (LOGIN_FAILED)
    IAM-->>GW: 401
    GW-->>U: 401 "Invalid email or password"
  end
  Note over GW,IAM: Every later request: Gateway verifies JWT signature,<br/>injects tenant_id into the query context (RBAC guard)
